    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, travels to a remote snowy valley with his brother for a skiing trip. But soon after their arrival, strange events begin to unfold. What was meant to be a peaceful getaway quickly turns into a nightmare. Over time, he realizes that something terrible is live in the valley...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852340/extras/e9567c11e3f8b1829d3d63971d7e30e2.avif?t=1753369167\" width=800 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features of the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric and scary sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality diverse locations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elaborate dialogues and game story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skiing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking up and examining things</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality cutscenes</p></li></ul>",
